        <mxCell id="r50XZ4u70VxxVtxbInAh-10" value="Copies created outside of the information supply chains can be avoided through&lt;br&gt;sound data management practices that minimises uncontrolled copying of data.&amp;nbsp;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
