        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ixPBNXtNek4q0AdiuXmp-4" value="Controlled copying of data through information supply chains is linked via lineage.&lt;br&gt;Deduplication may be used to improve search results and identify optimisations in&lt;br&gt;the information supply chain.&amp;nbsp;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
